    ObsidianProvider.swift:34 already guards against symlinked vault files
    resolving outside the vault root, but the only prior coverage was
    source-inspection (grepping the file for "hasPrefix"/"vaultRoot + \"/\"").
    Add a real test that creates a symlink inside a temp vault pointing to a
    file outside it and asserts query() returns no results for content that
    only exists in the outside file.

