+/// Maps raw EventKit / system errors to `CalendarError`.
+///
+/// Only `EKErrorDomain` code 100 (`EKErrorCode.notAuthorized`) represents an
+/// actual authorization denial. Every other EventKit or system failure
+/// (missing calendars, corrupt store, transient system errors, etc.) must
